Package: p2p-messenger
Version: 0.0.0
Maintainer: P2P Messenger maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6, libgl1, libfontconfig1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxrandr2,
 libxinerama1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0
Description: Decentralized end-to-end encrypted P2P messenger
 Pure Rust native desktop client using egui/eframe.
 Direct connections use libp2p TCP, Noise, and Yamux with no mandatory
 server, bootstrap peer, relay, webview, or browser runtime.
